## 5. Verification Commands

Run the following commands to verify repository compliance:

1. Verify file line limits:
   `./ooda/bin/ooda run openOODA/scripts/format_lint.oo`

2. Verify repository integrity:
   `./ooda/bin/ooda run openOODA/scripts/verify_all.oo`
